WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Okay, open the door

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,680
Let me meet this enthusiastic classmate

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,040
My name is Chen An

4
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,040
He is the owner of this room

5
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,360
I worked hard to upgrade the door to 5G

6
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,480
Stocking up on 5G

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,960
It’s not just to be seen as a shrewd person.

8
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,800
On the premise of ensuring your own safety

9
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,320
Fame can bring huge benefits

10
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,720
As for effort and adventure

11
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,160
Just let your hands go and do it.

12
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,400
I just have to sit in my room and be the king

13
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,280
Classmate Chen An

14
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,400
If you are willing to lead us against the bandits and provide shelter

15
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,480
All residents on our floor

16
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,160
They are all willing to let you be the boss and listen to your orders.

17
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,160
Talking loosely is like a wolf with empty gloves

18
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:36,680
It’s impossible for me to hand over my scarce resources to you.

19
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,680
If you really want to increase the urban-rural ratio

20
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,160
i can help you

21
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,680
Only 5 gold coins are needed

22
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,640
I can sell you one

23
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,720
Wooden liaison with 15 Nu swords

24
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,800
Now on the trading platform

25
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,920
Normal contact costs 15 or even 20 gold coins.

26
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,920
The price I give you is more than half cheaper than outside.
